{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_01",
  "title": "初醒",
  "storyCode": "WR-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8e38e12e3d7ffde2ceb754604e6bcc9d7baca90d44ec63c0467df9bd81b0a487",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為那個跛腳書生在那晚切實完成了諾言，切實畫出了“世間從未有過之物”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼感覺和書上寫的內容不大一樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老夫子來不及說出為什麼，或者壓根就說不出為什麼就咽了氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "於是坊間流傳的說辭，就只有跛腳書生從春風得意到失魂落魄的這麼一段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於真相如何，恐怕無人知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是畫沒見過的東西，那有什麼難的嘛，我回去亂塗一幅，你們不也沒見過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，話不能這麼說。你從沒見過大湖，但見過雨後積水，我便告訴你，湖是很多的積水。說到底，你還是見過的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這跛腳書生，厲害就厲害在這兒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那照你這麼說，他到底畫了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰知道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，能不能別老講這麼複雜的，什麼時候講講其他的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要聽上次那“形單影隻向天去，雌雄雙劍分天下”的大結局！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "會講的，都會講的。天下講不完的事，我用寥寥百年的陽壽去講，要是還奢求面面俱到，就有點貪得無厭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你們想聽，那下一回就講點別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好耶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老規矩，我這張嘴，不值錢。但是諸位的茶錢，得看著給。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今日似乎有幾位新面孔，不知三位客人對我這些奇聞怪談，可還滿意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......這是真事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若是說有個書生染了礦石病，遂願之前便鬱鬱而終，我倒確信是件真事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "添油加醋，方有滋味啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "在理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只不過，我也不知道這些奇聞野史，到底有幾分是真的......只是有這方面的興趣，僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "話說回來，我雖然不是什麼正兒八經的說書人，也在鎮上以此打發了許久光陰，不過願意來聽我胡說八道的，其實就那麼幾位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這看著三位面生，不知？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "咳——（使眼色）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啊——是了是了，我這兩位朋友，遠道而來，要找個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "不過這二位在咱們大炎這裡人生地不熟的，所以我就略幫小忙，代為引路，不知先生怎麼稱呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我離家多年，早就棄了舊名不用。早年舞文弄墨，自號“煮傘居士”，雖有些恬不知恥，但也沿用至今。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "好意境！好意境啊！這不巧了，小弟也是被迫無奈，背井離鄉，如今也只好借“烏有”二字暫代姓名，不如你就喊我烏老弟吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "（我就說他這名字是編的吧——！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（噓......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "（克洛絲？你發現什麼了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（嗯？啊，沒有啦，我只是覺得看他每次都要生編硬套很好玩嘛。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來同是天涯淪落人，那不知道三位要找的人，是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "俗話說得好，相逢即是緣，真是巧得不能再巧了。我們要找的人，也是個畫家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......畫家？這小鎮不大，可從未聽說過有什麼畫家。是個什麼樣的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "呃......恩人？您和他說說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "是一位女性。呃，頭上應該長著奇特的角。還會一些奇特的法術。然後......然後......是個畫家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......就這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這麼一說，就更沒印象了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唔，這就奇了怪了......莫非二位恩人要找的人，已經離開了這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這小鎮極少有來客，要是如各位所說，那位奇人當給我們留下印象才是。我可以托人幫你問問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "好，好，那就不叨擾先生了，我們這就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "這就......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "烏有先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "喂，你怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啊，嘿嘿，我們......我們是從哪裡進來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你在說什麼，我們不是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——沿著這條小道，便可離開園林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想必幾位是跟著人群來這裡，迷了路吧？哈哈，我這園子不大不小，實在認不得路，問個傭人便是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "嘿......你瞧我這糊塗的，怎麼就記不住了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若是關於那位畫家，找到了什麼線索需要幫忙，儘管問我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還有點事情，諸位，不送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "誒，多謝多謝，不用送，不用送。二位恩人，我們先走吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "接下來，我們去哪裡瞧瞧？這茶館，驛站，園子都去過了，還有什麼地方可能有線索的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......我們到這裡多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唔，怎麼突然問這個？大概......三兩天時日？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你確定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啊哈哈，唉，多半是昨天晚上沒睡好，我有點迷糊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小炎熔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嗯......我感覺到了......但是很模糊的......好像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這種時候還是要跟著直覺走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "直覺告訴我，現在情況很麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是某種精神層面的源石技藝......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嗯......法術的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "二位恩人，還嘀咕啥呢？再不走快點，天就要黑啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "說什麼呢，天色還——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——天......色？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們竟然從來沒有看過天空......？明明只要一抬頭就能發現的......真奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩、恩人，這是啥情況？你看那邊，好像......好像都出月亮了呀！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可現在不是大白天嗎，橋那頭怎麼都點燈籠了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看身後......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "耶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......另一個方向的天邊，那是......是太陽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，是不是從那頭到這頭走個來回，就相當於\"走過了\"一天一夜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這還真......新奇。總是聽年說大炎地大物博無奇不有......還有這種景觀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，等等，我口袋裡好像有什麼東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是，年給我的護身符......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "慢著......慢著！不對，不對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "什麼叫“這種景觀”啊，我剛才在想什麼......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "烏有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "誒——？我在，我在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "這裡到底是不是泥翁鎮！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "這......這還用說......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "這，這仔細看看似乎是有點不對，可這附近也沒有別的鎮子了呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......還是不對，不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "克洛絲，我們從羅德島出發，先抵達了勾吳城，補給之後，翌日上午出城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然後我們在前往灰齊山的荒原上看見了一輛撞毀的車——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——然後二位恩人從那些畜生手裡救下了我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是把它們帶到了適合築巢的新窩而已啦。它們也挺不容易的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "然後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "然後我們......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯嗯，然後我們直接登上了灰齊山，找到了一間破茅屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "我推開了那裡的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......門？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "鐘聲？哪裡的鐘聲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敲鐘了？敲鐘了！喂，快去把家裡人都喊起來！動作快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼回事！都這麼長時間了！為什麼會是今天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "那個......！請問發生什麼了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們，你們是外人？敲鐘就說明西邊的山裡來怪物啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些怪物見不得光，只要跑到有太陽的地方，就安全了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "怪，怪物？什麼怪物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，沒空和你瞎嘮叨啦！別擋著我，我得把老婆帶到這兒來呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "媽媽！媽媽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都在這兒了嗎？還少誰！快去找找！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人，恩人，咱們也趕緊去避難吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "說是只要跑到有太陽的地方就沒事了？那咱們趕緊——恩人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......克洛絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "準備好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——恩人！？別鬧啦，我們自己都是一團漿糊，還是先躲躲再說吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "誒！誒誒！這怎麼就衝過去了！唉！我的好恩人呐，你們——等我，等我一下啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
